{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/pulls/80","id":4954968790,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAABJ1bS1g","html_url":"https://github.com/guidomodarelli/rustdom/pull/80","diff_url":"https://github.com/guidomodarelli/rustdom/pull/80.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/guidomodarelli/rustdom/pull/80.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/issues/80","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/pulls/80/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/pulls/80/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/issues/80/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/statuses/95e64bd20711975b08864cf1bef1dee362b79663","number":80,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: liberar clases nativas cuando falla su construcción","user":{"login":"guidomodarelli","id":38738725,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NzM4NzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38738725?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guidomodarelli","html_url":"https://github.com/guidomodarelli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guidomodarelli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guidomodarelli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guidomodarelli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guidomodarelli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guidomodarelli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guidomodarelli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guidomodarelli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guidomodarelli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guidomodarelli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Los errores al construir o envolver una clase N-API podían dejar sin dueño la asignación Rust. El guard conserva ownership hasta registrar el finalizer y libera el valor ante errores previos, incluidos tipos zero-sized. XMLSerializer resuelve propiedades desde Rust preservando getters, receivers, realms, reentrada y errores. El runtime sigue híbrido.\n\nEl candidato aislado combina decisiones de StaticRange en Rust y colapso atómico de Range. La matriz funcional 40168321423 aprobó 6/6 en Linux/macOS/Windows con Node 22.12.0/24.14.1. Se seleccionó prospectivamente artifact 12589402298/ELF567f6bff; el paquete 5b67fcc6 conserva candidato, controles, dependencias y fuentes. No se reconstruyó ni se integró todavía. La calificación de 64 procesos preservó 192 warmup, 576 duraciones y observaciones separadas de 768 Window/Document, con tres rondas y dos estados finales claros; ocho primeras rondas no claras siguen visibles.\n\nLos estudios históricos conservan sus rechazos. El nuevo método prospectivo mide una media aritmética por proceso y usa 16 pares e intervalos Fieller del 95% puntuales; exige los 64 intervalos completos dentro de los presupuestos originales ±2%/±5%. Conserva 2048 procesos en ambos SDK, ocho filas, AA/AB, seeds, warmup, outputs y cleanup. No se añaden muestras ni se repite una secuencia por fallar. No hay aceptación de rendimiento hasta una decisión íntegra de la futura captura.\n\nEl método completo exige recibo independiente y grafo exacto. La activación vincula el CI al workflow/SHA/intento y ambos jobs reales, y fija el binding de run/job antes del artifact. La decisión extrae de nuevo desde ZIP/TAR autenticados, verifica payload, binding, publicación, 2048 progresos y resultado terminal, exit-code y conclusiones API. Los lectores preservan parciales y recuperan el TAR interrumpido sin repetir mediciones. Nunca ejecutan código archivado; los fixtures y 64 funcionales no se convierten en evidencia científica de 2048.\n\nValidación local de este método: 36 contratos Node y 14 Python por SDK oficial, 13 comandos correctos y actionlint; 723 dependencias, recibo de 724 archivos, 599 pins y grafo histórico 434 intactos. El CI anterior 40182447893/SHA3735 aprobó 2/2; artifacts 12595051295/12595175736, metadata y logs están autenticados. La QA final conserva 64 miembros. Un contrato por SDK usa un manifiesto inválido antes de cargar DOM y no recoge workloads. Los ciclos binarios conservan 4 descriptores antes/después; no prueban memoria pico ni ausencia universal de fugas.\n\nLa ejecución declara 201 minutos: setup 14 + captura 175 + archivo 4 + upload 3 + margen 5. El minuto adicional corresponde a materialización y consultas del gate exacto. Los tiempos científicos y presupuestos no cambian; workflows históricos intactos. El WSL anterior quedó conservado tras E/S; la reproducción usa una distribución aislada de imagen oficial verificada.\n\nexecutionReady=true habilita únicamente el workflow con recibo y CI obligatorios; no aplica la etiqueta ni acepta rendimiento. Faltan CI sobre este SHA final y la captura científica única con replay íntegro en ambos Node. Sin tag/merge de ownership antes de aceptar rendimiento, integrar el candidato y comprobar la revisión y checks finales. La autorización permanente está concedida; cuota remota de review agotada, revisión local aislada sin pendientes. Preservadas 48 entradas ajenas y watch compartido.\n\nEvidencia: [recibo completo](https://github.com/guidomodarelli/rustdom/blob/95e64bd20711975b08864cf1bef1dee362b79663/reports/validation/combined-process-capture-method/review.json), [QA final](https://github.com/guidomodarelli/rustdom/tree/95e64bd20711975b08864cf1bef1dee362b79663/reports/validation/combined-process-study/20261025-activation), [CI3735 íntegro](https://github.com/guidomodarelli/rustdom/tree/95e64bd20711975b08864cf1bef1dee362b79663/reports/validation/combined-process-study/40182447893), [protocolo](https://github.com/guidomodarelli/rustdom/blob/95e64bd20711975b08864cf1bef1dee362b79663/reports/benchmarks/native-class-ownership/combined-process-study/PROTOCOL.md), [recursos](https://github.com/guidomodarelli/rustdom/tree/95e64bd20711975b08864cf1bef1dee362b79663/reports/memory/combined-process-study/20261025-activation) y [handoff](https://github.com/guidomodarelli/rustdom/blob/95e64bd20711975b08864cf1bef1dee362b79663/reports/progress/HANDOFF.md).\n\nLa migración general continúa activa e incompleta. No hay porcentaje defendible mientras el inventario completo siga sin auditar.\n","labels":[{"id":12789203293,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAAC-kvBXQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/labels/ownership-hosted-main-v1","name":"ownership-hosted-main-v1","description":"Activación única del contraste completo de ownership con paquetes oficiales","color":"5319e7","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12789712787,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAAC-lOHkw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/labels/ownership-single-package-v1","name":"ownership-single-package-v1","description":"Contraste único ownership: una distribución por proceso","color":"8250DF","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12790407744,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAAC-l4iQA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/labels/ownership-independent-order-v1","name":"ownership-independent-order-v1","description":"Ejecutar una vez el contraste con orden de motores independiente","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12802570645,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAAC-xe5lQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/labels/xml-full-inputs-v1","name":"xml-full-inputs-v1","description":"Una única secuencia XML con inputs completos y protocolo revisado","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12803409765,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAAC-ySHZQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/labels/xml-native-properties-v1","name":"xml-native-properties-v1","description":"Una única medición del candidato con propiedades XML en Rust","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12804646280,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAAC-zdliA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/labels/ownership-current-source-v1","name":"ownership-current-source-v1","description":"Medición única de ownership del candidato actual; no volver a aplicar","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12807861634,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAAC-2h1gg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/labels/ownership-jsdom-telemetry-v1","name":"ownership-jsdom-telemetry-v1","description":"Diagnóstico CPU GC JIT autorizado; una captura, sin aceptación","color":"5319e7","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12812031130,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAAC-6gUmg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/labels/ownership-shared-fixtures-v1","name":"ownership-shared-fixtures-v1","description":"Una única secuencia del método prospectivo de ownership con fixtures compartidos","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12814581569,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAAC-87_QQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/labels/ownership-native-mutation-telemetry-v1","name":"ownership-native-mutation-telemetry-v1","description":"Una única secuencia diagnóstica de MutationRecord/100 en Node22/24; no acepta rendimiento","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12821370764,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUXCYvs8AAAAC_DaXjA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guidomodarelli/rustdom/labels/ownership-cold-cleanup-v1","name":"ownership-cold-cleanup-v1","description":"Una única secuencia autorizada del candidato de limpieza fría; no volver a aplicar","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"archived_at":null